stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CONNECTING: observe connection
    CONNECTING --> CONNECTED: route available
    CONNECTING --> ERROR: route test failed
    CONNECTED --> DISCONNECTED: Wi-Fi/mobile data lost
    CONNECTED --> CONNECTING: network changed
    DISCONNECTED --> CONNECTING: network restored
    DISCONNECTED --> ERROR: recovery failed
    ERROR --> CONNECTING: retry or network change
    CONNECTED --> [*]: app closed
    DISCONNECTED --> [*]: app closed
    ERROR --> [*]: app closed
